[h1]Immersive Cigs - Rewrite[/h1]

[h2]Overview[/h2]
Enjoy smoking and being cool with your imaginary online friends?
Smoke cigarettes or suck some lollipops and let everyone around see and hear how cool you really are!

[list]
[*] Multiplayer-synchronised smoke, sounds and glow in the dark
[*] Light up your own cigarette - or someone else's
[*] AI carry cigarettes and smoke them on their own
[*] ACE Advanced Fatigue: chainsmokers cough, and coughing can alert enemies
[*] Spontaneous combustion when smoking next to fuel (ACE Fire)
[*] Pay respect to your fallen comrades with a last cigarette
[/list]
[url=https://github.com/CVO-Org/immersive-cigs-rewrite/blob/main/docs/players.md]All features and how to use them[/url]

[h3]How to Use[/h3]
Left-click the items in your inventory (cig packs, smokable and suckable items).
With ACE loaded, via the ACE Interaction Menu.

